{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:792297c2adaad955","name":"Sidearm Blaster Pistol","source":{"id":"source:reference-792297c2adaad955","title":"Sidearm Blaster Pistol","revision":20948,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:51:45Z","sha256":"94b37a641edb03a6d385161dc5a2bb57c4961b732282da2b25aff2d46060ddfe","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20948","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sidearm%20Blaster%20Pistol&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-792297c2adaad955","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sidearm Blaster Pistol is the generic term for Blaster Pistols that have a high ammunition efficiency rating. Created by BlasTech Industries under contract for the Grand Army of the Republic, the DC-15s Sidearm Blaster is a favorite backup weapon carried by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Commandos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Commandos"},". Although the shots that it fires are as powerful as those of other blasters, the Sidearm Blaster Pistol's slow recharge rate enforces conservation of ammunition, which can be advantageous in a prolonged firefight or when the wielder finds themselves behind enemy lines without access to additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Packs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Packs"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Sidearm Blaster Pistol requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. If you use a Sidearm Blaster Pistol with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"}," feat or any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"}," that has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"}," as a prerequisite, you must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to reset the weapon's trigger before it can be fired again. This feature and the special energy-trickle technology allow the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to last for 250 shots.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Small\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 400\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
